      "releaseNotes": "Adds persistent Back navigation through recently opened passages. Search now shows every match in natural author, work, and passage order. Also improves iPad rotation and sizing, prevents toolbar overlap on compact tablets and landscape iPhones, and refines reader scrolling, source notes, and Mac sidebar controls.",
