      "description": "Read the early Christian Fathers in a calm, parchment-styled library built for focused study.\n\nPatristic Library brings public-domain ancient Christian texts into a native reader with author browsing, work-level navigation, readable serif typography, search across the corpus, and a quiet Byzantine-inspired design.\n\nBrowse major figures from the apostolic and patristic eras, open individual works, search terms across the library, and read without web clutter or account setup. The corpus is bundled for offline use, so study can continue anywhere.\n\nBuilt for students, clergy, teachers, and curious readers who want primary sources close at hand.",
